  "ingredients": [
    "3/4 cup almond flour",
    "1/4 cup flaxseed meal",
    "1/4 cup erythritol",
    "1 tablespoon unsweetened dark cocoa powder",
    "1 teaspoon baking powder",
    "salt (to taste)",
    "3 tablespoon coconut oil (melted)",
    "2 large egg",
    "1/4 cup unsweetened carton coconut milk",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "20 drop red food coloring",
    "1/4 cup erythritol (powdered)",
    "1 tablespoon coconut oil",
    "2 tablespoon heavy whipping cream",
    "1/2 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "5 drop red food coloring"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat oven to 350F. Prep the dry ingredients by mixing the almond flour, flaxseed meal, erythritol, cocoa powder, baking powder, and salt.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-valentines-red-velvet-doughnuts/#wprm-recipe-50837-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/1-MixDryIngredientsTogether.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a separate bowl, combine all the wet ingredients. Melt the coconut oil and mix in the eggs, coconut milk, vanilla, and food coloring.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-valentines-red-velvet-doughnuts/#wprm-recipe-50837-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/2-MixWetIngredientsTogether.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slowly incorporate the wet ingredients into the dry mixture, mixing well to remove any lumps.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-valentines-red-velvet-doughnuts/#wprm-recipe-50837-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/3-MixWetintoDry.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once the mixture is thoroughly combined, pour it into a plastic bag. Cut a small hole in the corner of a plastic bag and use it to pipe the batter into each indent of a mini donut tray.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-valentines-red-velvet-doughnuts/#wprm-recipe-50837-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/4-FillPlasticBagwithIngredients.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake for 13–15 minutes or until a toothpick comes out clean. If making larger-sized donuts, factor in 18–20 minutes for the baking time.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-valentines-red-velvet-doughnuts/#wprm-recipe-50837-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/5-FillDonutTrayandBake.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the donuts are in the oven, we can create the icing. Start by using a coffee or spice grinder to powder the erythritol. Let powder settle before removing lid.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-valentines-red-velvet-doughnuts/#wprm-recipe-50837-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/6-PowderErythritol.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once powdered, add all of the icing ingredients and whisk everything together until well combined. Use a container that's small enough to submerge the donuts but large enough not to make a mess.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-valentines-red-velvet-doughnuts/#wprm-recipe-50837-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/7-CreateIcing.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once the icing is complete, and donuts are out of the oven, dunk each donut. Let the icing harden by placing them in the refrigerator.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-valentines-red-velvet-doughnuts/#wprm-recipe-50837-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/8-DunkDonutsinIcing.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "These can be served as a fun appetizer or a romantic dessert. They can also be decorated or colored differently for different occasions. Enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-valentines-red-velvet-doughnuts/#wprm-recipe-50837-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
